    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17427" root="زبل" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُبَالَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Sweepings.</i> (Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كنس</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And
hence, <i>Anything;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِبَالٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَبَلَةٌ</span>.] One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا فِى الإِنَآءِ</span>, (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البِئْرِ</span>, (K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السِّقَآءِ</span>, (TA,)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُبَالَةٌ</span>, i. e. [<i>There is not in the vessel,</i> or <i>the well,</i>
and <i>the water-skin</i> or <i>milk-skin,</i>] <i>anything.</i> (S,
K, TA.)

